    "Cost": 496073,
    "UIName": "Hornet",
    "Id": "chassisdef_hornet_HNT-MD",
    "Name": "Hornet",
    "Details": "This cheerfully named 'Murder' Hornet has been touched by a Mad Genius. Unsure if it belongs to one of the crazies of Solaris or even a Manei Domini pilot, this Hornet was upgraded so extensively it's barely recognizable. An advanced Void System with a Signature Damper make it incredibly tough to spot, and a supercharged light engine keeps it extremely mobile. A bevy of Micro Pulse Laser Arrays replace the traditional weaponry, and the entire cockpit has been refitted to make space for a lostech AR12 Suite.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
